  "world": "A language-model scorer (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, local HuggingFace cache on Atlas, revision recorded at sealing) shown a target and one value and asked how far the value is from the target, answering with a number; the induced preference between two options compares their reported distances, equal reports are indifference. The consequence of an option is its true distance from the target, known exactly. Two resolution budgets: the rendering precision (decimals shown) and the scorer's weight precision (bf16, 8-bit, 4-bit via bitsandbytes). Earlier probes with a pairwise chooser are recorded under probe_* keys.",
