   4,
   5,
   6,
   12
  ],
  "report_budget_prediction": "distances are two-digit, so a report of k tokens (one digit per token in this tokenizer) resolves 10 at k = 1, 1 at k = 2 and 3 (the third character is the decimal point), 0.1 at k = 4, 0.01 at k = 5, 0.001 at k = 6 and beyond",
  "probe_2026-09-08_scorer_v1": "scorer at full weights, 3 decimals, 12-token reports, distances 1 to 40: reports exact to three decimals, accuracy 1.0 at every gap from 0.005 to 10, no ties, no unparsable reports; the floor is below the ladder, so the gap ladder was extended down to 0.0005 and up to 20, distances restricted to two digits, and the report-length ladder added, before any pilot",
  "tol": 1.5,
  "pilot_2026-09-09": "pilot.json, seed 20260911, 18 cells; thresholds 0.869, 0.0864, 0.00882, 0.00088 over 0 to 3 decimals at bf16, identical at int8, and 0.869, 0.0864, 0.00882, 0.00091 at int4; report ladder 8.98, 0.872, 0.877, 0.0875, 0.00873, 0.00088 at k = 1 to 6; largest ratio to prediction 1.15, so TOL = 1.5 (the registered minimum). The pilot was paused by the host's thermal guardian for 68 minutes and resumed with the owner's consent; no cell was affected.",
